    <!-- ── Act 3: Compose them into one job ─────────────────────────────
         The hero shows each primitive on one page; this act shows what the
         subtitle promises ("all through one platform"): they chain. A recipe
         is a short pipeline, input to destination, and picking one rebuilds
         the chain, sends a pulse through it and fills the result table. Plays
         once on entry and once per pick, never loops (the hero already
         moves). Data in home.js (HJ_RECIPES); Crawl is the "discover the
         URLs" step (Catalog discovery, and a pick in Your own). Replaced the four product cards, which
         repeated the hero statically (2026-10-03). -->
    <section class="hj" data-act="products" aria-labelledby="hj-h">
      <div class="hj-inner">
        <header class="hj-head">
          <h2 class="hj-h2" id="hj-h">Compose them into one job.</h2>
          <p class="hj-sub">The same primitives chain into the pipeline your case needs, from a list of pages to rows where you work.</p>
        </header>
        <div class="seg-control seg-control--md hj-recipes" role="tablist" aria-label="Recipes" data-hj-tabs></div>
        <ol class="hj-chain" data-hj-chain aria-live="polite"></ol>
        <div class="hj-result panel">
          <div class="hj-result-bar"><span class="hj-result-name" data-hj-dest></span><span class="hj-result-status" data-hj-status></span></div>
          <div class="hj-table-wrap"><table class="hj-table" data-hj-table></table></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

